WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
In the supplied fictional intake example, the original

00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:06.258
design treated complete information as permission to deliver.

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:09.543
The revision separates the human approval gate and

00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:12.945
shows an explicit hold state. The reflection cites

00:00:12.992 --> 00:00:16.219
that changed decision and the retained tabletop retest.

00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:18.936
It does not claim measured savings or complete

00:00:18.971 --> 00:00:22.575
prevention of future errors. The final demonstration shows

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.849
an ordinary path and absent approval, then explains

00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:29.855
AI assistance and human decisions. Rehearsal questions stay

00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:33.675
labeled as rehearsal. An actual reviewer response must

00:00:33.721 --> 00:00:36.148
be recorded as it happened. Your human check

00:00:36.194 --> 00:00:37.588
does not award certification.
